  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458650
  exerciseText: 'Inventory system stores items, can add or remove items and check
    which items are inside.


    In the Scenario the Player can move around, touching
    items in the world adds them to the Inventory, and pressing F can drop the last
    picked up item.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files,
    so if you want to keep your own personal implementation of this System then make
    a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
